data: {"answer": "這裡是「湖畔別墅・智慧客房」，主要展示電子門鎖、智慧溫控和電視系統。房務設施部（分機 1700）負責管理這些設備，重點在於確保科技安全並執行退房時的隱私重設。你可以看到不安全的物聯網設備威脅，以及退房隱私重設的防護措施。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "客房智慧控制與電視是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Smart Room Controls & TV do?", "zh": "客房智慧控制與電視是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "不安全的物聯網設備要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent insecure IoT devices?", "zh": "不安全的物聯網設備要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.92, "total_s": 8.94}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "villa_out", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "villa_out"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.3}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "villa_out", "label": "Room", "en": "Lake Villas", "zh": "湖畔別墅"}, {"key": "room_controls", "label": "System", "en": "Smart Room Controls & TV", "zh": "客房智慧控制與電視"}, {"key": "door_locks", "label": "System", "en": "Electronic Door Locks", "zh": "電子門鎖系統"}, {"key": "iot_default", "label": "Threat", "en": "Insecure IoT Devices", "zh": "不安全的物聯網設備"}, {"key": "checkout_reset", "label": "Control", "en": "Checkout Privacy Reset", "zh": "退房隱私重設"}, {"key": "c_it_ot", "label": "Concept", "en": "IT, OT & IoT", "zh": "IT、OT 與物聯網"}], "edges": [{"a": "checkout_reset", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "villa_out"}, {"a": "door_locks", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "villa_out"}, {"a": "room_controls", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "villa_out"}, {"a": "iot_default", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "room_controls"}, {"a": "iot_default", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "door_locks"}, {"a": "iot_default", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "villa_out"}, {"a": "c_it_ot", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "villa_out"}, {"a": "c_it_ot", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "room_controls"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：湖畔別墅・智慧客房\n代表的資訊主題：電子門鎖、智慧溫控和電視把每間別墅連上渡假村的系統。\n重點：客房的科技要安全，客人走了也要把他的資料清掉。\n在這裡的部門：房務設施部（分機 1700）\n這裡的系統：客房智慧控制與電視、電子門鎖系統\n這裡要注意的威脅：不安全的物聯網設備\n看得到的防護措施：退房隱私重設\n課程概念：IT、OT 與物聯網\n相關的處理流程：退房時重設智慧客房\n可以走到：湖畔別墅套房・客人隱私、泳池・資料湖", "converted_to_traditional": true, "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.92, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 593, "prompt_s": 2.87, "gen_tokens": 74, "gen_s": 6.01, "tok_per_s": 12.3, "first_token_s": 2.91}}, "state": {}}

